{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls5_jpg\\math\\120.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Unitary Method", "conf": 0.872, "box": [[73, 144], [261, 138], [261, 169], [74, 174]]}, {"text": "Father bought 12 tube lights for the home which", "conf": 0.95, "box": [[215, 189], [694, 182], [695, 211], [215, 218]]}, {"text": "cost Rs. 6,900 altogether. What will be the price", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[215, 223], [693, 216], [694, 242], [215, 249]]}, {"text": "of 7 such tube lights?", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[214, 256], [429, 251], [429, 278], [215, 283]]}, {"text": "Find the price of 1 tube light-by division. Multiply", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[127, 365], [608, 359], [608, 388], [128, 394]]}, {"text": "price of tube light with to find the price of 7 tube lights.", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[126, 404], [663, 394], [664, 424], [127, 434]]}, {"text": "Price of 12 tube lights = Rs.6,900", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[262, 452], [606, 449], [606, 475], [262, 479]]}, {"text": "Price of 1 tube light", "conf": 0.887, "box": [[263, 501], [465, 501], [465, 527], [263, 527]]}, {"text": "t= Rs.6,900 -12", "conf": 0.789, "box": [[450, 499], [657, 495], [657, 523], [450, 526]]}, {"text": "= Rs. 575", "conf": 0.827, "box": [[483, 549], [592, 547], [593, 574], [483, 576]]}, {"text": "downloaded from awazeinqilab.com", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[13, 567], [46, 567], [46, 1069], [13, 1069]]}, {"text": "Price of 7 tube-lights = Rs. 575 × 7", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[259, 590], [638, 584], [638, 617], [260, 623]]}, {"text": "= Rs.4,025", "conf": 0.869, "box": [[476, 628], [604, 624], [605, 651], [476, 655]]}, {"text": "The price of 7 tube lights is Rs 4,025.", "conf": 0.88, "box": [[62, 660], [429, 656], [429, 683], [62, 686]]}, {"text": "There are 2940 pages in 30 notebooks. How many pages will be there", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[76, 700], [781, 697], [782, 727], [76, 730]]}, {"text": "in 14 such notebooks?", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[74, 734], [305, 732], [305, 758], [74, 760]]}, {"text": "Number of pages in 30 notebooks = 2940", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[76, 795], [514, 790], [515, 819], [76, 824]]}, {"text": "Number of pages in one notebook = 2940 - 30", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[75, 838], [561, 838], [561, 869], [75, 869]]}, {"text": "Number of pages in 14 notebooks = 98 ", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[71, 879], [490, 884], [489, 917], [71, 912]]}, {"text": "= 98 × 14", "conf": 0.82, "box": [[429, 922], [535, 924], [535, 952], [428, 950]]}, {"text": "= 1,372", "conf": 0.793, "box": [[425, 958], [516, 958], [516, 989], [425, 989]]}, {"text": "Thereare1,372in14notebooks.", "conf": 0.915, "box": [[51, 985], [381, 985], [381, 1008], [51, 1008]]}, {"text": "Key Fact", "conf": 0.834, "box": [[121, 1072], [222, 1072], [222, 1100], [121, 1100]]}, {"text": "Using unitary method, we find out the value of one unit and use it", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[64, 1113], [729, 1116], [729, 1143], [64, 1140]]}, {"text": "to find the value of multiple units.", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[62, 1156], [395, 1156], [395, 1182], [62, 1182]]}, {"text": "Explain the concept of the unitary method,by using the prices ofobjects of daily use.", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[113, 1222], [792, 1226], [792, 1252], [113, 1249]]}, {"text": "JOT-FORSALE", "conf": 0.893, "box": [[27, 1317], [177, 1313], [177, 1339], [28, 1343]]}, {"text": "113", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[420, 1313], [467, 1313], [467, 1343], [420, 1343]]}, {"text": "downloaded from awazeingilab.com", "conf": 0.89, "box": [[179, 1473], [749, 1473], [749, 1509], [179, 1509]]}]}